From: Dmitry Muhomor <muhomor.dmitry@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Jun 2023 13:44:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 65/67] add support for hooking LocationManager methods

(cherry picked from commit 89c9528313d760f8531f35cf8bef6ceaaab10b3a)
---
 .../java/android/app/ActivityThreadHooks.java |   3 +
 core/java/android/app/AppBindArgs.java        |   1 +
 .../android/app/SystemServiceRegistry.java    |   7 +-
 .../location/HookedLocationManager.java       | 103 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../server/ext/PackageManagerHooks.java       |   4 +
 5 files changed, 117 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 location/java/android/location/HookedLocationManager.java

